{"product_id":"total-development-program-skills-series-volumes-1-17","title":"Total Development Program – Skills Series (Volumes 1–17)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"566\"\u003eThe Total Development Program – Skills Series is a thoughtfully designed 17-volume collection that nurtures essential skills in young learners. From language and math to critical thinking, creativity, and problem-solving, this series provides a well-rounded approach to building abilities that support academic and personal growth.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"908\"\u003eEach volume focuses on a specific skill area, allowing children to progress systematically while reinforcing prior learning. Engaging activities, colorful illustrations, and interactive exercises make learning fun and practical. The series is suitable for children aged 3–10 and is perfect for home learning, classroom use, or guided study.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"934\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1003\"\u003eTitle: Total Development Program – Skills Series (Volumes 1–17)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1057\"\u003ePublisher: Educational Technologies Limited (ETL)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1085\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Books\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1107\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809456316569,"sku":"3RA235","price":300.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251021_191748.jpg?v=1761060099","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/total-development-program-skills-series-volumes-1-17","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}